"<p>In addition to templates, you can deploy your own proprietary web applications directly from Git repositories.</p>\n<h2>Deploying from a Repository</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>Navigate to <strong>Apps -> New App -> Git Repository</strong>.</li>\n<li>Enter your repository clone URL (HTTPS or SSH with deploy key).</li>\n<li>Specify the target <strong>Branch</strong> (e.g. <code>main</code>).</li>\n<li>Select build method: <strong>Dockerfile</strong> or <strong>Nixpacks</strong>.</li>\n<li>Set environment variables and port mappings.</li>\n<li>Click <strong>Deploy</strong>. SaaSBase clones the branch tip and streams the build log in real-time.</li>\n</ol>"